+---
+id: task-002-implement-rfc-6902-json-patch
+type: task
+title: "Implement RFC 6902 JSON Patch"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implemented `applyPatch(document, patch)` with all six RFC 6902 operations. The implementation
+validates operation members and pointers, preserves input immutability through JSON-value cloning,
+and rejects failed operations. Added tests for normal operations, error paths, root replacement,
+RFC 6901 escaping, and safe handling of the `__proto__` member. Updated the README with the public
+API and an example.
